import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 401 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Body-Refining-System Critique: Predation Internalized as the Body Is the Battlefield","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 401 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Body-Refining-System Critique: Predation Internalized as the Body Is the Battlefield","no":401,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Body-Refining System","Divine-Demonic Body","Internalized Predation"],"related":["12-Life-Circulation System Detail","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0401_模块2-莽荒纪-炼体体系批判-身体即战场的掠夺内化.md","filePath":"en/0401_模块2-莽荒纪-炼体体系批判-身体即战场的掠夺内化.md"}'),s={name:"en/0401_模块2-莽荒纪-炼体体系批判-身体即战场的掠夺内化.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,h,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-401-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-body-refining-system-critique-predation-internalized-as-the-body-is-the-battlefield" tabindex="-1">Entry 401 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Body-Refining-System Critique: Predation Internalized as the Body Is the Battlefield <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-401-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-body-refining-system-critique-predation-internalized-as-the-body-is-the-battlefield" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 401 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Body-Refining-System Critique: Predation Internalized as the Body Is the Battlefield&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 6) | Benchmark base: Documents 12, 19, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-cultivation-becomes-refining-other-beings-into-your-own-bones" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when cultivation becomes refining other beings into your own bones <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-cultivation-becomes-refining-other-beings-into-your-own-bones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when cultivation becomes refining other beings into your own bones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiopmost detests &quot;treating the other as fuel&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings equal evolution. This entry specializes in decomposing Manghuang&#39;s <strong>body-refining system</strong> — it is colder than qi-refining: qi-refining only breathes qi, but body-refining must devour fierce beasts, refine divine-demonic blood essence, refine alien creatures&#39; bones and tendons into one&#39;s own body. Predation no longer happens externally, but is <strong>internalized</strong> into part of the body. The law-first axiom requires us to face squarely: does a &quot;body-is-battlefield&quot; cultivation method itself violate life ethics? Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Body-refining&#39;s energy waste lies in &quot;irreversible devouring loss&quot;: when a fierce beast or divine-demonic blood essence is refined, most of its life information and law comprehension is lost in the refining process; only bone-muscle strength is retained. The stronger Ji Ning&#39;s body-refining, the more beings&#39; complete lives are dimension-reduced to &quot;a few muscles&#39; density.&quot; <strong>Compressing an entire life into one segment of hardness is enormous energy-level waste.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Body-refining internalized predation&#39;s regression logic:</p><ol><li><strong>Hunting = ecological collapse</strong>: top body-refining cultivators must hunt high-tier fierce beasts; entire ecologies are hunted empty; demon-kind civilization has not even qualification to exist</li><li><strong>Bloodline pollution risk</strong>: refining alien blood essence makes the cultivator&#39;s own bloodline mixed; later inheritance difficult</li><li><strong>Kill-to-prove-Dao loop</strong>: the stronger body-refining, the more must kill; the more kill, the more ecology collapses; civilization&#39;s available resources fewer and fewer</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory core of Ji Ning&#39;s body-refining road:</p><ul><li><strong>The other as material</strong>: fierce beasts, divine demons, alien beasts in narrative are not &quot;living beings,&quot; but &quot;body-refining materials&quot; — this is the nakedest species discrimination</li><li><strong>Devouring = strength</strong>: body strength = devour amount; strength and killing are equated</li><li><strong>Dual-system double slaughter</strong>: Ji Ning both qi-refines and body-refines, equal to pumping qi while killing fierce beasts; predation coverage doubled</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Body-Refining System</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Life System</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hunt fierce beasts to refine body</td><td>Life-circulation system: symbiotic cultivation, energy conversion; not kill-to-prove-Dao</td></tr><tr><td>Refine divine-demonic blood essence</td><td>Myriad-Ranks differentiated cultivation paths; demon races as equal races not materials</td></tr><tr><td>Body strength = devour amount</td><td>Cultivation ethics and boundaries: must not devour other lives as evolution means</td></tr><tr><td>Ecology hunted to collapse</td><td>Environmental Protection Law: cultivation must not destroy biosphere</td></tr><tr><td>Mixed bloodline hard to inherit</td><td>Alaya records life information; study not devour</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s &quot;fierce-beast population — body-refining cultivator hunt volume — ecological carrying capacity&quot; model</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;hunting body-refining,&quot; &quot;symbiotic cultivation,&quot; &quot;Anchor life-circulation injected&quot; three paths</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: high-tier fierce-beast population survival rate, demon-kind civilization development index, cultivator physique improvement curve</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the hunting body-refining model, demon-kind population endangered within a century; under the symbiotic model cultivator physique also improves and ecology is perpetual</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Body-refining materials&#39; &quot;tier&quot; rises with plot; early refining a bear is already impressive, late casually refining a chaos behemoth</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Refining ratio, blood-compatibility never given hard rules; the protagonist always &quot;happens to be compatible&quot;</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. Body-refining resources monopolized by top cultivators; ecological order suppressed by the strongest</li></ul><p>The body-refining system also has an often-overlooked cost: it ties a cultivator&#39;s growth to killing dead-tight. Body strength equals devour amount, meaning the stronger a strong one, the more blood on his hands. This system&#39;s subtext is: kind people cannot cultivate the supreme physique — because they cannot bear to kill. What Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s life-circulation system overturns is precisely this premise: strength need not be at the cost of blood; a physique raised by symbiotic cultivation is no worse than devouring fierce beasts. One who moves the battlefield into the body will eventually discover his own body is full of others&#39; lives.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: complete lives dimension-reduced to muscle density; most information lost</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: &quot;the other as material&quot; is species-level internalized predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least did not treat alien beasts as pills; Manghuang body-refining directly writes foreign races into the menu</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: in the body-refining system demon races are not even a &quot;race,&quot; only a mine vein</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a system based on hunting, the wider it expands the wider the slaughter</li></ul><p>The body-refining system also at the social level creates a strange loop: the stronger a cultivator, the more high-tier fierce beasts he needs to hunt; high-tier fierce beasts fewer; cultivators to keep getting stronger kill into more dangerous regions; the more they kill the more ecology collapses; finally even low-tier fierce beasts cannot be found. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s life-circulation system uses symbiotic cultivation to replace hunting, equal to installing an exit for this vicious loop — the cultivator gets stronger, but the prey remains. Sustainable strength is truly strength; strength bought by hollowing out the world around is only early overdraft.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>What the body-refining system most deserves criticism is not that it is strong, but that it defaults &quot;the more other beings die, the stronger I become.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s life-circulation system gives another road: strength need not step on corpses; symbiosis can also buy physique. One who moves the battlefield into the body will eventually discover — his own body is only a material block in a larger food chain.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · body-refining-system critique · predation internalized as body-is-battlefield described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./400_模块2-莽荒纪-炼气体系批判-掠夺天地灵气的零和博弈.html">Entry 400 · Qi-Refining-System Critique</a> · <a href="./402_模块2-莽荒纪-境界膨胀批判-十六层境界的设定崩坏.html">Entry 402 · Realm-Inflation Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/12-生命循环体系详解.html">12-Life-Circulation System Detail</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
